WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.959
Watch and read: For your connections practice, read: “Ama found a red ball at the

00:00:04.959 --> 00:00:09.717
playground. Ama gave it back to Kojo. The day ended happily.” Who is the main

00:00:09.717 --> 00:00:10.035
character?

00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:14.984
The answer is: Ama. The character is the person the story is about.

00:00:15.867 --> 00:00:21.989
Watch and read: Ama asks: Ama opens an age-appropriate story about school. What shows

00:00:21.989 --> 00:00:22.864
independent reading?

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:29.140
The answer is: Try to read and use nearby clues before asking for help. Use print and

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:31.060
meaning clues with less teacher support.
